out.push(A('_Three sentences, each naming its criterion:_ **"On the three sentences in order: three headed paragraphs of one sentence each, and I read all three, which is the only test that matters. On both halves of sentence 2: _the contract is theirs to tender_ is the half I left out of mine and it is the half that does the work. On the gap held open: _whether the present arrangement continues_ is exact, and the sentence about what the clerk could not put in writing is better than closing the gap would have been."**'));
