  '**The rewrite, which is twenty-one words.** _"The printed timetable has shown a first departure of 06.40 since 2019; the first bus has left at 06.20 throughout."_',
  '**What I am not asking for.** I am not asking for a correction and I am not asking anybody to write about us again. I am asking nothing at all; I am telling you what two of your own sentences do when they are read together.',
